mitted preservative)","India_Status":"Permitted","US_FDA_Status":"Permitted","Korea_Status":"Permitted","Australia_TGA_Status":"Permitted","Canada_NHPID_Status":"Permitted","Vegan":"Yes","Natural_ISO16128":"No","SVHC_Flag":"No","CMR_Flag":"No","IARC_Group":"Not classified","Allergen_Flag":"Yes","Endocrine_Flag":"No","Max_Concentration_EU":"0.5%","Max_Concentration_India":"0.5%","Max_Concentration_US":"0.5%","Max_Concentration_Korea":"0.5%","Format_Restriction":"EU: must not be used in aerosol products; formaldehyde-releasing preservative - label warning required if free formaldehyde exceeds 0.05%","Baby_Restriction":"Yes","Pregnancy_Restriction":"No","IFRA_Restriction":"No","Common_Products":"Shampoos, conditioners, body washes, facial cleansers, baby wipes (with caution)","Key_Safety_Notes":"Formaldehyde-releasing preservative; releases formaldehyde slowly in aqueous solutions; risk of sensitization particularly in individuals already sensitized to formaldehyde; EU requires disclosure labeling when free formaldehyde exceeds 0.05%; avoid in products for children and formaldehyde-sensitive individuals.","TCS_Evaluator_Flag":"Yes","Data_Confidence":"High","Verification_Notes":"EU CosIng Annex V entry No. 33; SCCS opinion confirms formaldehyde-releasing nature; formaldehyde release rate depends on pH and temperature","Source_Reference":"EU CosIng Annex V; SCCS/1105/14; US Cosmetic Ingredient Review; Korea MFDS","Last_Updated":"2026-06-06"},{"INCI_Name":"Thimerosal","CAS_Number":"54-64-8","EC_Number":"200-210-4","Chemical_Name":"Ethyl(2-mercaptobenzoato-S)(sodium) mercury; Sodium ethylmercurithiosalicylate","Function":"Preservative, Antimicrobial","Category_Code":"P01","Category_Name":"Preservatives","Ingredient_Origin":"Synthetic","Concern_Level_TCS":"High","EU_Status":"Banned","EU_Annex":"Annex II (banned) - mercury compound; prohibited in cosmetics","India_Status":"Banned","US_FDA_Status":"Restricted","Korea_Status":"Banned","Australia_TGA_Status":"Restricted","Canad